{"version":1,"content":"<p>香港網球代表黃澤林（Coleman）昨天（1日）在ATP首爾挑戰賽男單決賽，兩度與法籍球手艾馬尼激戰至決勝局，其中在決勝盤力挽5個決勝分無果，以盤數1：2飲恨，連續兩年在此項賽事屈居亞軍，並繼上周南沙挑戰賽後再與冠軍擦肩。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T12:42:13.527864+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T12:09:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:38:26.407547+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T12:38:26.407547+00:00","content_hash":"dfe75a9ff7e018f7c1ad99dbf6e0be1be2b478c5186f75bdbcec832663431ee7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}